{"time": 1769535061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358207852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（行）"}
{"time": 1769535072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422405388", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“没想到这次上来就弄得这么声势浩大。”摇了摇头，坐上出租车"}
{"time": 1769535254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600375943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "魔力的波动是从北部的大溪谷传来的，本来是个荒郊野岭的地方，但是深夜的出租车司机看到如此爽快付钱外加不少小费，出手阔绰的莉维娅，还是矜矜业业的开车前往大溪谷。"}
{"time": 1769535318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286720981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "但是行至半途之时，就能看到天空中好似爆炸的火光和巨响。"}
{"time": 1769535370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962853305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "出租车司机立刻就认怂了：“这位小姐，大溪谷好像发生了什么危险的事，我看你是外地来的，不如还是先回安全的市区找个酒店住下吧。”"}
{"time": 1769535394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "837254488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“师傅，在这里停吧。”点点头，就在此处感受一下魔力，另外放出使魔去看看"}
{"time": 1769535510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339236633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅的魔力感知r70＋30"}
{"time": 1769535520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355942405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "感知一下魔力的构成，就可以离开此处，反正已经放出了使魔，“好了，师傅，回市区吧。”"}
{"time": 1769535522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629455583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd70+30"}
