{"time": 1769535539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1011090220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（大成功）"}
{"time": 1769535602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50530174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "可能是逸散的魔力浓度过高，加上距离太远的缘故，莉维娅只能感受到这是神代从者的魔力波动，有两位从者正在交战。"}
{"time": 1769535652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836824744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然是已经知道的信息，不过这次就这样了，毕竟还有凡人在场。"}
{"time": 1769535672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170129020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "放出的使魔不久传回画面。"}
{"time": 1769535817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528962471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "天空中一名身穿金甲的金发王者，手持散发红色魔力波动的“剑”，正在积蓄磅礴的魔力，而地面上，绿色头发的中性长发人物，也在汲取地脉的魔力。"}
{"time": 1769535844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603238616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100吉尔伽美什的察觉"}
{"time": 1769535844, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1603238616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[吉尔伽美什的察觉]演奏出:[1D100=88]"}
{"time": 1769535917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "315547980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“似乎有小虫子被我们二人的战斗吸引过来了啊，我的挚友恩奇都！”"}
{"time": 1769535935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1135192158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "天空中的金色王者如此发言。"}
{"time": 1769535979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921340527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，不过这也不会影响你我二人的寒暄是吧，吉尔！”"}
