{"time": 1769614456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "468685690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（别急，让我慢慢引出）"}
{"time": 1769614528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2376937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，这位小姐，您想要住什么样的酒店？对于您这样大方的乘客，我推荐的酒店是「水晶之丘」。”"}
{"time": 1769614569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "488928201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“虽然这酒店以赌场在雪原市本地出名，但是服务也是本地最好的。”"}
{"time": 1769614650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439049049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "出租车司机打开了电台，调了调频道，电台内正在播放对刚才南部沙漠发生的爆炸的新闻报道。"}
{"time": 1769614659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160107435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"赌场?\"稍微皱了皱眉，\"如果师傅推荐的话，只当酒店用也可以。\"表示自己同意了"}
{"time": 1769614687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083275084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "新闻说是燃气公司管道故障引发的爆炸。"}
{"time": 1769614752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734638847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好嘞小姐，这就带您去雪原市中央十字街，这里去雪原市其他地点也很方便，有着地铁站和商超等设施。”"}
{"time": 1769614801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1891330124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "进入市区，越往城市里行进，车流也逐渐多了起来，看起来这座城市是一座说一不二的不夜城。"}
{"time": 1769614902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "788572998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "夜晚 史诺菲尔德，也称雪原市，中央十字路口，此处是以赌场旅馆「水晶之丘」与市政厅为首，聚集城里许多重要设施的第七街。"}
{"time": 1769614920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737007104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "窗外的风景确实有意思，一路稍微看看"}
{"time": 1769614980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331927281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "r70+30莉维娅的魔力感知"}
