{"time": 1769621943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450981342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "捷斯塔的攻击打在莉维娅展开的魔法结界之上，被刚好挡下。"}
{"time": 1769621957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883641184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦？还有点本事嘛。”"}
{"time": 1769622051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "462430691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"想看看，圣杯现在承不承认我。\"打着哈欠，展开自己的人偶，看看手背"}
{"time": 1769622062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725433564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅要尝试在此时进行召唤吗？\n1/3/7、在此时召唤\n2/4/8、还是等安定下来在工坊内召唤\n3/6/9、令咒自己出现在莉维娅手上了\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769622162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570784664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
