{"time": 1769624947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393392892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "可能是捷斯塔还未死亡，或者是死徒的特殊性，将令咒安全完整剥离，并且转换主从契约用了不少时间。"}
{"time": 1769624961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181056685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子也正巧找了回来。"}
{"time": 1769624994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697817456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“长老，你这是…从死徒那里获取了令咒？并且更改了契约？”"}
{"time": 1769625014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635932570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"感受一下自己和狂信子是不是已经连接在一起了"}
{"time": 1769625043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1001475707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "确实能感觉和狂信子的联系。"}
{"time": 1769625059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425628842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“也就是说，我现在是长老的从者了，太好了…”"}
{"time": 1769625092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906431935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么莉维娅非常熟练的布置好了魔术工坊，狂信子回来之后，现在要做的事情是？\n1/2/3/5/8、尝试召唤从者？\n4/6、在布置完之后电话打过来了，是二世\n7、电话打过来了，是横飞姬\n9、门外传来了敲门声\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769625096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254270061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（来）"}
{"time": 1769625100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816107181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"这样对方也能稍微安心一些了吧，\"不过～这并不能算是我召唤的从者啦。\""}
{"time": 1769625102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "909381475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769625102, "type": "reply", "message_id": "909381475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=8"}
{"time": 1769625179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "440924274", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"接下来，我该试试...\"搬出人偶，\"Assassin，我来参加这场莫名圣杯战争的原因之一——有人将女神凭依在人偶之上，为此。\""}
{"time": 1769625227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986461791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也要试一试啦，试一试。\"露出好奇的笑容，\"我自信自己的人偶不会比他们差!\""}
{"time": 1769625253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792591243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“召唤女神？这种事情长老也做得到吗？”"}
{"time": 1769625263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434234356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子颇为震惊。"}
{"time": 1769625344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348546711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "根据从老友那里获取到的情报，爱因兹贝伦家召唤了伊什塔尔凭依在人造人身上，并且这次圣杯战争出现了从者吉尔伽美什和恩奇都。"}
{"time": 1769625360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "766010922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅如此心想到。"}
{"time": 1769625381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "741716970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，只是试一试又不会吃亏啦。\"笑着摸摸狂信子的脑袋，\"不行的话就算了嘛，而且，这一次的美索不达米亚含量是不是有些超标?\"自言自语，\"说不定，我也能连锁一位神明啦。\""}
{"time": 1769625530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1165632583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"苍天神安努、恩利勒、水神恩基...嗯...不过...\"内心逐渐锁定了最有可能的人选，\"吉尔伽美什史诗中，和伊什塔尔相关的那位——\"看向狂信子，\"拜托Assassin护法一下啦。\""}
{"time": 1769625591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "449108826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“遵命，长老。”\n狂信子推到一旁戒备。"}
{"time": 1769625747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2049837534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么，莉维娅围以准备好的人造人素体为中心，画好了召唤阵。"}
{"time": 1769625800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703008537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "深吸一口气，等待召唤的时刻"}
{"time": 1769626073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "621047463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我今天看月球史，伯爵好像暴打死徒)"}
{"time": 1769626163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1409133531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "似乎是某位存在进入了雪原市，召唤阵也一同被连锁，发出光芒。"}
{"time": 1769626206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1346576995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在此情况下，莉维娅口中念念有词，念出召唤词。"}
{"time": 1769626256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392401804", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "光芒散去之后，人造人睁开了眼睛。"}
{"time": 1769626260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1061984434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"宣告。汝之身躯居吾麾下，吾之命运寄汝剑上。\"皱了皱眉，已经有了连锁的现在，省略中间的唱词，\"显现吧，天平的守护者。\""}
{"time": 1769626271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137741216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "光芒散去之后，人造人睁开了眼睛。"}
{"time": 1769626284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695609244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后，她开口——"}
{"time": 1769626292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840374586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "等待她的开口"}
{"time": 1769626313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "779636098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“从者，Lancer。冥界女主人，埃列什基伽勒。应召唤前来。尽管我不怎么愿意将力量借给一个人，但既然被你召唤，我还是会帮你的。好好感谢我吧。”"}
{"time": 1769626379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922004981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这具人造人素体是金发吗？\n1、是\n2、是白毛\n3、黑发\n4、莉维娅头发同款颜色\n5、其他颜色"}
{"time": 1769626428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673758475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd5"}
{"time": 1769626428, "type": "reply", "message_id": "673758475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D5=1"}
{"time": 1769626460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672427081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，我感知到了这里好像有其他美索不达米亚神话的存在，难道master你是因为这个原因召唤我的？”"}
{"time": 1769626468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834926310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（最经典款式的艾蕾）"}
{"time": 1769626482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "214217865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=1CF6BD9C55CCD4C154E7F3FEA6A02DAA.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSaqx7bCNdukTsKMIsN_nnghlnbWxib5AQg_woo2LemrvSukgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQIZepV8bvgWakooTTEPjHjHoCeDiCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMOBe1GzsaqeFFmr3lj-p4doirP5mFFacRW4okn6L7vALhJUDLowthoCmSWcnfAuxPA,file_size=78363]"}
{"time": 1769626510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78356782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"果然如此。\"笑着看向从者，点点头，\"有人召唤了伊斯塔，吉尔伽美什王和恩奇都也接连现世，既然如此。\""}
{"time": 1769626530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045198129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100艾蕾什基伽勒对莉维娅的第一印象"}
{"time": 1769626586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348365073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"冥界的女主人当然也会驾临此处，我名叫莉薇娅，圣杯无法解决我的诉求，但...若是lancer需要，介入这场战争也很有意思呢。\""}
{"time": 1769626588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931422349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1769626588, "type": "reply", "message_id": "931422349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=65"}
{"time": 1769626603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146203625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还行)"}
{"time": 1769626628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1508827562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾什基伽勒虽然是混沌恶属性，但是意外的对莉维娅这个master的第一印象还行。"}
{"time": 1769626752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366778829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没想到伊什塔尔那家伙也被召唤了啊…那家伙可是一年会闯一次毁灭世界级祸的女人，那看来这次圣杯战争会很多灾多难的。”"}
{"time": 1769626792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2006672207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "金发的艾蕾自顾自地说到，同时注意到了莉维娅的眼神。"}
{"time": 1769626841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516237598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你的眼神好像在问我为什么会知道？这是秘密啦，毕竟我也算是她的姐姐嘛，不要问这么多。”"}
{"time": 1769626867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728504886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "笑着点了点头，\"嘛，正因为是麻烦女神，所以有lancer在这里，才更好处理不是?\"伸展一下四肢，\"必要的时候，就再现那次传说好了。\""}
{"time": 1769626911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700118447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“喂，说谁是麻烦女神呢！”\n艾蕾有些脸红地抗议。"}
{"time": 1769626933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170677882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子：“女神，就是这样的人物吗？”"}
{"time": 1769626968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "313129398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "总之，现在已经是早上10点多，已经可以将早饭和午饭合起来吃了。"}
{"time": 1769626981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118045730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样也很好相处嘛。\"揭过话题，\"不过，有一件事还是需要询问。\"目光看向艾蕾，随后看向狂信子，\"虽然我没有需要圣杯实现的愿望，不过...你们呢？\""}
{"time": 1769627017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1196897137", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "既然已经在水晶之丘定下最豪华的房间了，莉维娅也要了三份餐点。"}
{"time": 1769627034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42804872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"女神艾列什基迦勒的愿望...\"叹口气，\"无名assassin的愿望。\"一边点好餐点"}
{"time": 1769627079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "254522768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子立刻就坚定的回复：“圣杯是异端，不能交由那些邪恶的魔术师使用，所以长老，最好由我们拿到手销毁。”"}
{"time": 1769627162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2035492100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"轻声应声，看向艾蕾，等待回应的同时轻声\"这个时代的餐点很好吃哦?女神大人一定要多尝一尝。\""}
{"time": 1769627200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "298958008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“圣杯？　我有兴趣。既然是卓越的魔力资源，那可以有效运用在各种地方。但是除此之外并没有什么特别要实现的愿望呢。”"}
{"time": 1769627237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400965970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“优先阻止伊什塔尔那个家伙闯出大祸才是首要目标。”"}
{"time": 1769627255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075218474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2035492100]“那当然，多谢了master！”"}
{"time": 1769627314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034076338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然如此，那我们也算得上是无欲无求的一伙人了。有什么想吃的你们点啦。\"不免有些好笑，拨通和横飞姬的电话"}
{"time": 1769627388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "525219814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅是否获取了额外的令咒？\n1/3/5、获取了3条\n2/4/7/8、获取了d3条\n6/9、并未获取新令咒\n10、混沌的超展开"}
