{"time": 1769663123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860884011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "横飞姬当然是很快就接了电话。"}
{"time": 1769663125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277051436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没事，他会给你发信息)"}
{"time": 1769663172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018737934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“喂喂，刚才日出时候的巨大动静是莉维娅亲弄出来的吗？”"}
{"time": 1769663212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908992696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“难道是和Assassin和她的主人打起来了？”"}
{"time": 1769663269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109656704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"动静难道很大吗？\"仔细回想一下，\"我个人觉得我动手已经很快了。\""}
{"time": 1769663351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627904182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"举办这场圣杯战争的家伙真是有够不检点的。\"吐槽，\"死徒都能塞进来当御主吗？弗朗索瓦。\""}
{"time": 1769663464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "923776487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“因为啊…你不觉得人理敌人和守护人理的从者组成一组参加圣杯战争是一件很有趣的事吗？哈哈哈～”"}
{"time": 1769663482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664767920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "电话那头传来笑声。"}
{"time": 1769663559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510471995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"有些无语地扶了扶额头，看看自己的右手手背，\"好啦，先说正事，我已经正式参与这场圣杯战争了。\""}
{"time": 1769663584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708155409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“虽然只显露了很短的时间，但是那股神灵级的庞大魔力不是作伪呢，我想大多数人应该都注意到了吧，不过应该不清楚是莉维娅亲你，因为他们根本不知道莉维娅亲能做到这种程度嘛！”"}
{"time": 1769663647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17252644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是，你就是想看到这种事，才会把我喊过来吧？\""}
{"time": 1769663690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045554601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哦哦，那莉维娅亲已经召唤从者了吗，是Saber吗？还是…某个金发的Ruler呢？快跟我说说！”"}
{"time": 1769663751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597853641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这边完全没收到新从者召唤的消息呢，看来还是莉维娅亲的魔力工坊太强了！”"}
{"time": 1769663778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883137930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你不如说会召唤你中意的吉尔元帅好啦。\"心里对她的恶趣味腹诽，\"当然不会有——\""}
{"time": 1769663809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711195945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟日出时的动静，就是我为了剥离死徒的令咒而做的。\""}
{"time": 1769663884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109465213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？为什么不让死徒接着当御主呢…那多有趣啊！不过，换成莉维娅亲当御主也是一样或者更加有意思！”"}
{"time": 1769663916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318760920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那莉维娅亲是Assassin御主的同时，还是什么职阶从者的御主？”"}
{"time": 1769663956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909853995", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“按道理来说，赝作的英灵已经全部召唤完毕了，除了Saber…”"}
{"time": 1769663978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1271020110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没有真Saber的召唤，应该是不能召唤出其他职阶的从者的说。”"}
{"time": 1769664104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333882998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我有不得不这么做的理由。不过...原来如此，那我暂时也只能算是赝作的御主了。\"有些好笑地开口，\"你自己也想参与其中吧？弗朗索瓦\""}
{"time": 1769664106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970103302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我手机就5%的电了嘻嘻）"}
{"time": 1769664119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314438199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害喵)"}
{"time": 1769664410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392249524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=333882998]电话那头传来女童不满的声音\n“那是当然，这种有趣的事情肯定要参与进来，如果能召唤出那位圣处女就更好了，可惜赝作的圣杯没有选中我呢，我还要等到真正圣杯战争的开始…这么说来，不愧是莉维娅亲，这种情况都能召唤从者。”"}
{"time": 1769664424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2044309321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100横飞姬的推理"}
{"time": 1769664424, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2044309321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[横飞姬的推理]演奏出:[1D100=18]"}
{"time": 1769664453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1824431779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嘛…还是推测不出来是什么原因呢，莉维娅亲能告诉我你的从者是哪一位吗？”"}
{"time": 1769664502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807451465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?不介意你再多夸夸我哦?\"笑了笑才继续开口，\"告诉你是可以啦，不过～我们还是实际见一面好啦。你知道我在哪。\""}
{"time": 1769664611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480328155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，不过我这里暂时走不开，要不莉维娅亲等下来警察局大厦？我会通知局长有客人要来的。”"}
{"time": 1769664709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687037875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以吧——正好我也想见一见你的合作者。\"停顿，\"感觉很有意思，会和你合作的家伙。\""}
{"time": 1769664759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037190366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就这么说定了，拜拜～”"}
{"time": 1769664763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895789094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "电话挂断了。"}
{"time": 1769664837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085866176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "坐在豪华真皮沙发上的艾蕾点完餐转过头来，询问：“听起来是你的熟人，御主，可以信任吗？”"}
{"time": 1769664974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517766965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可以信一点点。\"皱着眉开口，\"那家伙，嗯...比起人理，更在乎自己有没有乐子看，呵...执着于贞德的人可真多啊。\""}
{"time": 1769665017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511557212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"他也是因为这个原因，才会喊我来这里吧。\"摇摇头，\"吃完饭我会去一趟。\""}
{"time": 1769665105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607076641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那就好，这场圣杯战争很奇怪，连伊什塔尔和吉尔伽美什那家伙都出来了，不知道还会出现什么奇怪的状况，这两位就够让人头疼了，当年没少让我头疼。”"}
{"time": 1769665153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140841354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "很快，门外就响起敲门声，是服务员推着餐车来了。"}
{"time": 1769665188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "43924344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟艾蕾是稳重款嘛。\"打趣道，去门口开门，\"有你在的话，相信应该也不会有什么意外。\""}
{"time": 1769665286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587311870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“水晶之丘”酒店的「星耀盛宴」餐厅，以剧场式烹饪闻名。主餐是28天干式熟成和牛战斧牛排，外沿炭烤出酥脆焦壳，内里保持樱桃红的三分熟度，搭配黑松露骨髓酱与烤至半透明的波特酒洋葱。\n\n特色菜黄金鱼子酱海胆塔堪称奢华：底层是脆炸藕片，中层铺满北海道海胆，顶部以24K金箔包裹的奥西特拉鱼子酱收尾，入口如海浪在舌尖迸发。\n\n甜品桌中央的 “欲望轮盘”巧克力蛋糕 是一场赌城风味的冒险：六种夹心（热情果凝乳、山核桃太妃、樱桃白兰地等）随机分布，每一刀都是惊喜。佐餐可点分子芒果胶囊香槟冻，鱼子酱状的外壳在口中绽开冰凉气泡感。"}
{"time": 1769665313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343643766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "还有众多小食和不同菜品，看起来艾蕾和狂信子点了不少。"}
{"time": 1769665350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790838920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子看着琳琅满目的菜品，有些不好意思地看向莉维娅：“长老，破费了。”"}
{"time": 1769665487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617153163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "总之，午餐时间过的相当愉快。"}
{"time": 1769665510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012250260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没关系啦。\"靠着沙发坐下，\"以后喊我的名字就行，现代社会已经没有长老的说法啦。\""}
{"time": 1769665569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688627574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“好…的，莉维娅。”狂信子还是有些不适应。"}
{"time": 1769665589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237044247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那我也可以叫你莉维娅吗？毕竟你都叫我艾蕾了。”"}
{"time": 1769665735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532891396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"点点脑袋，\"这样称呼会方便很多吧。\""}
{"time": 1769665806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016511354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "用完餐收拾一下就打算去拜访一番警察局。"}
{"time": 1769666413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2120150697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我看看）"}
{"time": 1769667142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014303919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（警察局有很多人物）"}
{"time": 1769667150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335535799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那个确实不少)"}
{"time": 1769667159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56252275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怪物集团说是)"}
{"time": 1769668327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294621517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（睡午觉睡一会儿）"}
{"time": 1769668337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2031455272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1769703118, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1551066077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1769703127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987646724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（怎么自己开了）"}
{"time": 1769703173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442847428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我帮你)"}
{"time": 1769703206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "728037310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "看到莉维娅收拾东西要出门的艾蕾：“啊，你要出去吗，莉维娅酱？”"}
{"time": 1769703266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1105746000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“能不能带上我和Assassin一起呢，干待在酒店有些太无聊了。”"}
{"time": 1769703301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82472480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd60+40艾蕾和狂信子的关系"}
{"time": 1769703341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699050267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd60+40"}
{"time": 1769703341, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1699050267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D60+40={27}+40=67"}
{"time": 1769703367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524388042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒也没什么问题，一起吧\""}
{"time": 1769703623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211701880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，难道就这样让我们俩上街？”"}
{"time": 1769703661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734952001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾指了指狂信子的一身漆黑的袍子，以及自己的灵装。"}
{"time": 1769703693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "201223959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…我可以灵体化。”\n狂信子回应到。"}
{"time": 1769703742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022579113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“但是我不行啊，我是凭依在人造人身体上的，没有灵体化这个选项。”"}
{"time": 1769703759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889619199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你是不是还在打三角洲啊）"}
{"time": 1769703790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348582156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没)"}
{"time": 1769703794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1265395213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在等你说完)"}
{"time": 1769703806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1281113825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...人造人的话，可以穿我的衣服。\""}
{"time": 1769703885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182531488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"另外...assassin要不也穿一穿我的衣服?\""}
{"time": 1769703974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684499510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…可以吗，身为教团的一员，这样光明正大的在街上行动？”"}
{"time": 1769703980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364925750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子有些迟疑。"}
{"time": 1769704006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366106767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"当然没什么问题啦，这都什么年代了?\"耸耸肩，\"不应该问我?我的衣服合适吗？\"笑"}
{"time": 1769704042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "421032817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那…多谢了。”"}
{"time": 1769704052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470453062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子和艾蕾很快换好了衣服。"}
{"time": 1769704057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129727230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=B07702BB4F94369DD999764B42427078.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTSRAznOHnEzrqzrmuBQ8GXa-wXvxjIvAwg_woooLzorJWxkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQPn0EsXBQPabwhlsS52HbR3oCYdmCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMM4rA1uJfBVcpI4DLOhZDGf5h1HB1WgjK4sShr5fyQ1LV46xWOIoY5hkP-duysn_iA,file_size=204360]"}
