{"time": 1769793855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575246063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "正是横飞姬手机通知莉维娅：该去旧歌剧院看一出好戏了。"}
