{"time": 1769963966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "464371604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（天命不认识说是）"}
{"time": 1769964017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153244253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "由于理查并不认识莉维娅，但是又进行了识人＝97的大成功，所以现在是理查识人出了一个什么结果？"}
{"time": 1769964201, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295935428", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "1/5/6、眼前这个人身上有熟人的气息\n2/7、这个人说话方式好像生前遇到的吟游诗\n3/8、这个人的魔力波动像生前的宫廷魔术师\n4/9、难道是那个宫廷魔术师的后代？\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1769964303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1487516921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1769964303, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1487516921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=4"}
{"time": 1769964498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879363833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“难道…你是我那个宫廷魔术师的后代？脸长的好像！”"}
{"time": 1769964527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999682420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "理查仔细扫视过周遭后说道：\n“这情况，还真是有点奇特呢。”"}
{"time": 1769964568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317203423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这边还有一个跟哈桑教团有关的刺客小姐。”"}
{"time": 1769964631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195812407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“以及…女神吗？这届圣杯战争真是有好多不得了的东西啊！”"}
{"time": 1769964645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478454096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，你们两边是认识吗？”"}
{"time": 1769964655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "280080841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉...勉勉强强吧。\""}
{"time": 1769964671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205522897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "理查站在中间，看向狂信子又看向莉维娅艾蕾两人。"}
{"time": 1769964925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737907798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我并不认识你，只是看过画像啦。\"耸耸肩，\"反正...认识你的人也不可能活到现在吧?\""}
{"time": 1769964961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1783111651", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100理查的怀疑"}
{"time": 1769964961, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1783111651", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[理查的怀疑]演奏出:[1D100=76]"}
{"time": 1769965029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "139330293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100理查相信莉维娅的话了吗"}
{"time": 1769965029, "type": "reply", "message_id": "139330293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[理查相信莉维娅的话了吗]演奏出:[1D100=18]"}
{"time": 1769965040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309382911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（并不相信）"}
{"time": 1769965058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261503988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（刚才r出来也是怀疑，绷不住了）"}
{"time": 1769965089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621528253", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，就是不信)"}
{"time": 1769965114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757456336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“画像吗，我现在用的是我年轻时候的样貌，那时候好像没有画师给我画像啊。”"}
{"time": 1769965145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "222117566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "理查有些怀疑地说。"}
{"time": 1769965276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359004699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"总有一些民间的秘传嘛。\"点点头，\"比起这个...\"指着后面的金发女孩，\"这就是这次的御主吗？\""}
{"time": 1769965353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568956040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“啊，真是忘了问了…”\n\n理查对陷入茫然自失的金发少女说道：\n“试问，汝是我的主人吗？”"}
{"time": 1769965416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077204880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "地面跪坐的金发少女并没有出声。"}
{"time": 1769965435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715083639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "这时候，狂信子已经绕回到莉维娅身边。"}
{"time": 1769965450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "423043964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"定睛打量一下这个少女，对着狂信子摇摇头，但是没说什么"}
{"time": 1769965469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082635231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅长老，你看这剩下的这名…少女魔术师，还要不要…”"}
{"time": 1769965480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022823051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子比了一个抹脖子的动作。"}
{"time": 1769965559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166519829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，\"这应该是被卷入了这次圣杯战争...\""}
{"time": 1769965649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446458207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "金发的少女低下头，似乎是想起了什么。\n\n“我能当你是我的主人吗？我如你所见，职阶是Saber。既然你能接受的话，就赶紧缔结完契约──”\n\n随后，绫香以盖过理查讲话的方式立刻答复。\n\n“不是。”\n与其说她是已做好觉悟，不如说她是以接近半自暴自弃的态度从喉咙里挤出声音。\n“绝对不是。”\n\n金发少女奋力瞪向眼前这个金发男人\n“我已经…… 不会再任凭你们摆布。”"}
{"time": 1769965718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160796792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...反正，和我们的目的不冲突吧？\"看向她，\"只要可以肢解圣杯...\"皱皱眉，\"那这也是狮心王要解决的事情。\""}
{"time": 1769965745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "137622382", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾在旁边看戏看的津津有味，悄悄对莉维娅吐槽：“这个Saber和这个小姑娘怎么这么别扭啊，我看这俩人魔力有着浅浅的联系啊。”"}
{"time": 1769965875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486883113", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狮心王理查有些为难地说到：“原来如此，你不是我的主人啊，那也没办法。而且…这位刺客小姐和那边的神灵小姐都是你的从者吧…”"}
{"time": 1769965888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1713793164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不知道这位熟人的后代，如何称呼？”"}
{"time": 1769965918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362581107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100生前理查和他的宫廷魔术师关系"}
