{"time": 1769965941, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879017725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（现在只是熟人的后代罢了）"}
{"time": 1769965956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561131105", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"莉薇娅。\"耸耸肩，\"不过...这两位的关系这件事问弗朗索瓦就好了。\"看向身后，\"喂～弗朗索瓦，在吗？\""}
