{"time": 1770654109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594136904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(哦，好像确实)"}
{"time": 1770654187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102844586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅的声音在空荡荡的剧院大厅回荡，并没有人回应呢"}
{"time": 1770654207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455056378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“弗朗西斯卡是谁，你的朋友吗？”\n理查询问"}
{"time": 1770654312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1813076578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"算是吧？\"耸耸肩，这家伙这时候倒是学会装死了，\"算了，没回我，之后我再找她。\""}
{"time": 1770654428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1211524349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗯，既然这样，要不要我们先结成盟友？毕竟我看你也算是我熟人的后代，你怎么看，御主？”\n理查将绫香扶起来。"}
{"time": 1770654436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072900460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“都说了我不是你的御主…”"}
{"time": 1770654471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1659532209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "绫香虽然被拉起来了，但是听到理查这话又打开了理查的手臂。"}
{"time": 1770654485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710323487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过还是感谢你们救了我。”"}
{"time": 1770654508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448400828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Saber的召唤啊...虽然有些意外就是了。\"看一眼理查，曾几何时自己也在更近的距离看过他，摇摇头，收回视线，\"我个人是没什么意见哦?不过眼下重要的是你们的事情吧？\""}
{"time": 1770654543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118130968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100绫香对身后艾蕾的第一印象"}
{"time": 1770654575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "940945455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不用谢，沙条绫香。\"看向她，目光柔和了一些，曾在时钟塔见过的，现代魔术科上课的女孩，心说要不要待会联系一下君主。"}
{"time": 1770654581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545499956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1770654581, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1545499956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=32"}
{"time": 1770654613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697651401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1448400828]“确实，我现在还只是临时契约状态，如果遇到强敌就不太好办了。”\n理查困惑的挠了挠头。"}
{"time": 1770654918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719657901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"抱歉，这件事需要你们自己解决。\"摇摇头，\"我的落脚地在水晶之丘，有事可以去找我。走吧——\"招呼艾蕾和狂信子离开"}
{"time": 1770654948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596578671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1074700520]绫香刚才在地上由于光线问题没看清，，现在看清了莉维娅身后这位女神的脸和气质，瞬间联想到了某个派她过来的白发人影。"}
{"time": 1770654979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696018217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100绫香对愤怒的忍耐"}
{"time": 1770654979, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1696018217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[斯薇塔]使用[绫香对愤怒的忍耐]演奏出:[1D100=33]"}
{"time": 1770655030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1578927096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说，你身后这位是谁啊？跟爱因兹贝伦家有什么关系！为什么那么像那个女人！”"}
{"time": 1770655055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2058649295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "绫香又回想起了痛苦的被操控的回忆，一时间爆发了。"}
{"time": 1770655246, "type": "recv", "message_id": "451607038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"毕竟是姐妹，像也是正常的，\"呃...沙条?怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1770655295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600436337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但还是有点意外，自己的人偶应该不同于爱因兹贝伦的才对，\"那个女人?怎么了？做了什么？\""}
{"time": 1770655364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1230335518", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100艾蕾的灵感"}
{"time": 1770655450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534172656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd100"}
{"time": 1770655450, "type": "reply", "message_id": "534172656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D100=7"}
{"time": 1770655458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1927658641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(笨蛋女神)"}
{"time": 1770655559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628352701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（好想打满改M14）"}
{"time": 1770655565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456331825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（有力气的枪）"}
{"time": 1770655593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451086111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾听到绫香的话，脑子里似乎想起来什么，最后又给忘了。"}
{"time": 1770655699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148794782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，看来这里也是有一些误会的。\"摇摇头，\"沙条同学，这是我的从者，艾蕾亲，不是你口中的白发女人。\""}
{"time": 1770655703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66805646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…不，你们要做的事是肢解圣杯，如果是那个女人应该不会这样做…”"}
{"time": 1770655769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529542672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这具素体也不是你口中的爱因兹贝伦的人偶，而是我做的。\"按着自己的太阳穴，既然都这样了，干脆直接拨通韦伯的电话"}
{"time": 1770655774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1380904649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过可以分享一下情报吗？毕竟在我身上植入5道令咒的那个女人，气质真的跟你身后的那个金发从者很像。”"}
{"time": 1770655904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1262288670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "电话能打通吗？\n1、能，接通的人是韦伯\n2、能，但是接的人是教室的学生\n3、不能，没信号\n4、不能，由于位置原因，接通错人了\n5、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1770655968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1693259085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd5"}
{"time": 1770655968, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1693259085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D5=5"}
{"time": 1770656050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454190939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我姑且也算得上初来乍到，情报的话，肯定不如弗朗索瓦了解。\"认真地看着她，\"不过，请沙条同学问吧，我会知无不言的。\"感觉越来越麻烦了，瞥一眼艾蕾"}
{"time": 1770656425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052411837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "超展开\n1、能，接通的人准备坐飞机过来的韦伯\n2、能，但是接的人是准备最飞机过来的远坂凛\n3、不能，剧场被结界屏蔽了信号\n4、不能，电话信号被干扰接到Caster了\n5、能，但是接的人是弗拉特\n6、不能，接电话的时候有敌人！\n7、能，但是电话串线到神秘女人了\n8、不能，手机没电了\n9、能，但是接电话的是准备坐飞机过来的朵丽丝罗森德拉\n10、混沌的超展开"}
