{"time": 1770774825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089675997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"和韦伯说了几句话，他拜托我照看你们。\"停顿了一下，\"或者说，君主埃尔梅罗二世。\""}
{"time": 1770775104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473282133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100韦伯对莉维娅的信任"}
