{"time": 1770775572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112537976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“算了，既然这样那我还是先找一个安全的地方从长计议吧。”"}
{"time": 1770775588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708942278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“话说地上那个…”"}
{"time": 1770775595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428119477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "绫香看向地上死去的男人。"}
