{"time": 1770775809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938541247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然韦伯拜托我照看你，不过终究你已经是saber的御主，我只尽照看之责，其他的事情还是需要你和你的从者做决定。\"认真地看着她"}
{"time": 1770775940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1687206239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd100绫香对莉维娅的信任"}
