{"time": 1770776626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362662471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?我也要走一趟吗？\"举起双手示意自己没有恶意"}
{"time": 1770776755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2087658727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（完全原作向展开）"}
{"time": 1770776775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "167122728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“报告，发现被焚烧的尸体一名。”"}
{"time": 1770776814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1918359124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "其他警员忙碌的收集证据，为首的警员过来准备给你们戴上手铐。"}
{"time": 1770776821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275632096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（进局子了）"}
{"time": 1770776890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82797534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉。\"耸耸肩，\"陪你们走一趟吧。\""}
{"time": 1770776894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401667524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沙条凌香只能无奈地配合，理查看了看莉维娅和狂信子，做了一个守住秘密的手势，配合警员。"}
{"time": 1770776916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014808270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "老老实实戴上手铐，跟着走"}
{"time": 1770776927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142627307", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个…莉维娅你要不要给白天那个警长打个电话。”"}
{"time": 1770776934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171384418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾凑过来问。"}
{"time": 1770777045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952477597", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?只是觉得很有趣?反正肯定有人在警局等着我。\"稍做思考，\"而且这件事，那家伙还要给我一个解释。\""}
{"time": 1770777567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "607725569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那么众人坐上警车到了警局，迎接5人的是\n1、局长亲自迎接\n2、局长＋横飞姬\n3、局长＋神父\n4、局长\n5、没人迎接，送往临时监狱\n6、局长\n7、局长＋横飞姬\n8、局长＋神父\n9、路上出车祸了\n10、混沌的超展开"}
{"time": 1770777643, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807632534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
{"time": 1770777643, "type": "reply", "message_id": "807632534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上悠子]演奏出: 1D10=6"}
{"time": 1770778213, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2060643349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人刚进入警察局，局长就出来迎接了。"}
{"time": 1770778238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028249080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "额头有些冷汗的局长命令警员给你们解开了手铐。"}
{"time": 1770778283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1535466593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沙条凌香看到此情景发觉莉维娅背景不简单。"}
{"time": 1770778332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912858051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“真是抱歉，有人举报旧剧院有谋杀案，没想到竟然是你们。”"}
{"time": 1770778346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353169587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "局长领着你们到办公室落座"}
{"time": 1770778488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350381491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不能说是谋杀吧，但也可以说是我们做的。\"坐下开口，\"我的从者看见施暴的魔术师就有些忍不住动手了。\""}
{"time": 1770778563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755180186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那具尸体出自我的手笔，不过没想到会是从者召唤的现场呢。\"无奈地摇摇头，\"弗朗索瓦呢？那家伙让我去的歌剧院。\""}
{"time": 1770778609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "628184556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那么旁边这位小姐也是圣杯战争的参加者是吧，这位相比就是从者了，该如何称呼？鄙人奥兰多·里维。”"}
{"time": 1770778644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1462319820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1755180186]“弗朗索瓦先行回到魔术工坊了。”"}
{"time": 1770778902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "99889217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"想必那家伙也在准备召唤从者了。\"摇摇头，\"我们可以先离开吗？君主托付给我照看孩子的事情，我得确认一下那个麻烦的学生。\""}
{"time": 1770779024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802811600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=628184556]“沙条凌香…”\n“叫我理查就行…”"}
{"time": 1770779073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109109810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=99889217]“如果各位有事，那就先行离开就好了。”"}
{"time": 1770779092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343913039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过，如果阁下能帮我一个忙就更好了，此事跟那个死徒有关。”"}
{"time": 1770779141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026734331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“我们今晚打算在警局设下结界，吸引死徒过来诛杀，但是…最好的吸引人员，应该就是阁下你的从者。”"}
{"time": 1770779149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894743211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "局长看向狂信子。"}
{"time": 1770779215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359975601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今晚?\"点点头表示了然，看向狂信子，\"如果能彻底了解那个死徒，不过这件事还是要看她的意见。\""}
{"time": 1770779393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623949996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“倒也不必从者本人留下来，只要是相同魔力波动的物品就行，我听闻阁下是杰出的炼金术师，如果能在短时间内制作出人偶一类的物品就行。”"}
{"time": 1770779446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936648708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我姑且问一句。\"看向局长，\"你们打算用什么办法围杀他。\""}
{"time": 1770779844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911286206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“实不相瞒，我们有人手一个的拟造宝具，多人合力定能将那死徒斩于马下。”"}
{"time": 1770779935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613133863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行。\"摇摇头，\"我和他交过手，作为人类之敌，仅凭人类之身和拟造宝具，无法对他造成伤害。\""}
{"time": 1770779963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223328539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这一点我已经确认，如果只是这种程度，你们拦不住他。\"眯着眼"}
{"time": 1770780569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108348014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那看来有必要和圣堂教会的人合作…吗。”"}
{"time": 1770780579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589753990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“感谢阁下告知情报。”"}
{"time": 1770780642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172782602", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"既然你们有意围猎，这个忙我也不能不帮，稍晚的时候请来水晶之丘，我的住处取吧。\"留下地址，转身离开"}
{"time": 1770780914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1191924169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沙条凌香和理查跟着莉维娅三人一起出了警察局大门。"}
{"time": 1770780954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474653695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅…女士，和警察局长是熟人吗？”"}
{"time": 1770780965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58781420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "沙条凌香询问"}
{"time": 1770781007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28337004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒也不算吧。\"耸耸肩，\"只是之前有过一面之缘啦。\"回头看着她，\"是不是说明我人缘很好?\""}
{"time": 1770782902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442311487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1773161873, "type": "reply", "message_id": "324415104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1773161946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344905328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一行人两从者一神灵两御主，沿着警察局外的道路行走直到十字路口分别处。"}
{"time": 1773161973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664784588", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100绫香的分别想法"}
