{"time": 1773161994, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1266784740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[我叫五个五]的人物卡:\n1. 风铃儿 [default/default]\n2. 安欣 [default/default]\n3. 瑟提 [default/default]\n4. 月神夜 [default/default]\n5. 小黑 [default/default]\n6. 斯薇塔 [default/default]\n7. Bluefin_Tuna [COC7/C3]\n\n当前选择:[Bluefin_Tuna]"}
{"time": 1773162018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624540550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。st 小黑"}
