{"time": 1773163959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1413096569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么都不知道)"}
{"time": 1773164003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "334724661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd100艾蕾的感知"}
{"time": 1773164003, "type": "reply", "message_id": "334724661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[小黑]使用[艾蕾的感知]演奏出:[1D100=80]"}
{"time": 1773164056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951694407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "就在莉维娅制作完成后的不久，艾蕾表示有同为乌鲁克神灵的气息。"}
{"time": 1773164082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860196945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这感觉，似乎是吉尔伽美什那家伙…不知道他来这里干什么。”"}
{"time": 1773164119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230919212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"要去见见他吗？\"这件事听从艾蕾的意见"}
{"time": 1773164288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964425054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那当然，这里也算是我们先来的，怎么能不尽地主之谊呢？”"}
{"time": 1773164367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275208446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收拢一下衣服和慵懒的表情，递出手，\"走吧，艾蕾带路。\""}
{"time": 1773164398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702696300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾和狂信子换了一身赌场用的黑色连衣裙装，准备前往赌场。"}
{"time": 1773164450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702364177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "三人随着电梯下到水晶之丘大厦的底中层区域，这里连续三层都是赌场。"}
{"time": 1773164504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815426782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一开电梯门，就能很明显感受到赌场的氛围感，金色的灯光，配上骰子和老虎机的转动声，以及空气里传来的香槟气味。"}
{"time": 1773164519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236608755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "充满了奢华与糜烂的金钱气息。"}
{"time": 1773164559, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799908197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己倒是见多了这样的氛围，并没有很感兴趣，\"那家伙是这样的人?\"皱眉，\"我以为，会是有名的贤王才对。\""}
{"time": 1773164668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1434978674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可别提了，他刚开始统治乌鲁克的时候真是一个恶棍。”"}
{"time": 1773164703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040297628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=EEA028D6BC1B578781DBF3F05EE88FCE.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTo6rrh703HmToU6ovZeIL-yP3Qshj8igUg_woo2e_UofGVkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQoAtD5Fs7mG7PdwuIt3MsvXoCkWaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMPAO_KAj5s6U49il3Bbh5YodVCoyXYCTie-ctCw8XmwTRP-r57g_55HlzYtN9ueN2A,file_size=83324]"}
