{"time": 1773164724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801132333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(一生要哭三十次)"}
{"time": 1773164756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599590015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"噗...\"扑哧笑了一声，\"那有名的恶棍先生在哪呢?\""}
{"time": 1773164825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58590472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅和狂信子跟着戴墨镜的艾蕾前进，很快就看到了一处人群聚集的赌桌。"}
{"time": 1773164835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031183267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“全部压黑色。”"}
{"time": 1773164917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789674484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "一个穿着一身红色昂贵西装的金发从者坐在轮盘旁将自己的筹码全部推到押注黑色区域。"}
{"time": 1773164942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868223135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "旁边的一名戴眼罩的黑发男子也表示他要压黑。"}
{"time": 1773164965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810908492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅一眼就看出这名戴眼罩的男子是圣堂教会的神父。"}
{"time": 1773164980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1447150906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而金发的男子就是吉尔伽美什。"}
{"time": 1773165015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471847742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?\"饶有兴趣地看着，走到两人身边，自己没有带筹码来，看向神父，\"可以借我点筹码吗？\"伸出手，掌心躺着圣堂教会的十字架，目光狡黠。"}
{"time": 1773165018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165936008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在吉尔伽美什不远处，站着一位身高不到1m5的白色礼裙萝莉。"}
{"time": 1773165046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670974072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "她皮肤是健康的小麦色，这就是吉尔伽美什的御主了。"}
{"time": 1773165103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036028075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "神父看着莉维娅手心的十字架，眼底有些惊讶。在神父发话之前，反倒是坐着的那位金闪闪发话了。"}
{"time": 1773165192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895656096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哼，你就是那边那个冥界女神和Assassin的御主吗？当着本王的面这样做，胆子不小啊！”"}
{"time": 1773165241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1113100431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "*狂信子这时候上前递给了莉维娅一盒筹码，都是最高面值的，加起来有100w美金。"}
{"time": 1773165272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453711200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“从赌场前台那里用房间卡登记预支的。”"}
{"time": 1773165285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136267143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后她就退到身后。"}
{"time": 1773165295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397631259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"见谅，有名的恶棍先生。\"收起十字架，笑着提起裙摆行礼，\"毕竟这里是我们先来，您作为后到的人，我们有欢迎的义务。说起来，真是金光闪闪的呢～\"说完对着狂信子点点头，把筹码放进黑色的池子。"}
{"time": 1773165339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938837201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“说什么呢吉尔伽美什，这里可算是我们的地盘，凡事都得讲究先来后到吧。”"}
{"time": 1773165360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755905920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾摘下墨镜，做到吉尔伽美什对面。"}
{"time": 1773165386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020323682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "而神父看到眼前的情景，已经开始捂着额头头痛了。"}
{"time": 1773165424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101723693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随着所有人下注完毕，在工作人员启动后，转盘果然转到黑色。"}
{"time": 1773165493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161495861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "众人都分得属于自己的那份奖励。"}
{"time": 1773165548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "740104010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后吉尔伽美什发话：“既然都是熟人，那还是换一种方式吧，你说呢，冥界女神？”"}
{"time": 1773165588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680827251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?偶尔借用一下金光闪闪先生的运气，确实不错?\"看着神父，出声调侃，不过听到这话翻了个白眼，\"喂，嫌你今天弄出的动静不够大吗？\""}
{"time": 1773165594, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122288647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那自然奉陪到底啊！”随后艾蕾偷偷看了看莉维娅，表示要用莉维娅的钱了。"}
{"time": 1773165674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670262460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=680827251]“原来就是你这杂修偷偷观看我和恩奇都的叙旧啊，不过没想到你能召唤出冥界女神，本王还是认可你的才能。”"}
{"time": 1773165751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729427663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把赢到的筹码递给艾蕾，表示随便花就好，\"毕竟弄出太大的动静，有违神秘的原则。\"打个哈欠，眯着眼看向神父，\"神父桑，借一点你的筹码不过分吧？\""}
{"time": 1773165998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903622437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“无所谓，只要最后能还给我就行。”随即他将所有筹码都推给了莉维娅，自己只拿走了一个。"}
{"time": 1773166061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294963857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在艾蕾和吉尔伽美什商量好后，几个人转移到了德州扑克的场地，打算进行一场单挑。"}
{"time": 1773166111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062981834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这么乱来的圣杯战争也有监管者吗？\"跟神父站在一起围观，有一搭没一搭地聊着"}
{"time": 1773166114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602025423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾手握筹码表示要大赢特赢这个家伙。"}
{"time": 1773166168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852733487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“没办法，毕竟是我们的工作，等下我还要去警察局一趟，他们跟我分享消息说发现了死徒的踪迹，我得去处理那个。”"}
{"time": 1773166181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "484011810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“就凭警察局那些人，估计是处理不了的。”"}
{"time": 1773166211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634472700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "神父在手中把玩着那枚筹码。"}
{"time": 1773166260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449846069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦，既然你收到了委托，那待会帮我把他们拜托我做的东西送过去吧。\""}
{"time": 1773166298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792609145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个死徒我也遭遇了一次。\"兴致缺缺，\"你们应该可以很轻松解决。\""}
{"time": 1773166504, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788213550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "神父表示可以。"}
{"time": 1773166536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650624432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "牌桌上此时也进行了几局游戏。"}
{"time": 1773166579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687591222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾和吉尔伽美什的德州对战结果是？\n1～4艾蕾胜\n5～9金闪闪胜\n10平局"}
{"time": 1773166585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065771989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd10"}
