{"time": 1773166606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454192937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(闪大哥不是区)"}
{"time": 1773166638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040831842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么了，在冥界待久了脑子不好用了吧，这牌也敢加注？”"}
{"time": 1773166662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677209118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "金闪闪展示他的俘虏豪斯，而艾蕾仅仅只有两对。"}
{"time": 1773166696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "33142579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可恶，你在嚣张什么啊，不就是仗着自己有黄金律吗？”"}
{"time": 1773166707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904339925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后艾蕾看向莉维娅。"}
{"time": 1773166718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820311515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅，你要不要上来和他打一把？”"}
{"time": 1773166740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221357050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"Keep poker face。\"收到目光，走到艾蕾身边，\"可以啊，不过用技能作弊是允许的吗？\"看向对手"}
{"time": 1773166869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "805030092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嘛，既然杂修觉得自己能作弊瞒过本王的眼睛，那你大可以试试，只要不被本王发现就不算，如何？”"}
{"time": 1773166911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792933756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾起身对莉维娅做了一个加油的动作，把位子让给了莉维娅。"}
{"time": 1773166924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273972211", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我接受了。\"坐下来，\"发牌吧。\""}
{"time": 1773166945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "67484354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(该运转卡巴拉提高运气属性了)"}
{"time": 1773167059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "617438178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "那rd13"}
{"time": 1773167072, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144092299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "rd2次决定莉维娅的牌"}
