{"time": 1773168537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937066433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还要追加吗？\"摇摇头笑了笑，\"你的意见呢，金闪闪先生。\""}
{"time": 1773168548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471588616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“这一把本王要认真了！”\n闪闪坐直身体喝了一口香槟，身上的气势也增强不少。"}
{"time": 1773168624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1904258027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "发牌员看到如此之强的气势，有些站不稳了。"}
{"time": 1773168677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1217660590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哼，终究是凡人吗？”\n随后闪闪招呼身后的黑皮萝莉。"}
{"time": 1773168773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949804572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不如让本王的部下担任发牌员，如何？”"}
{"time": 1773168798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869740887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "蒂妮·切尔克上前，自我介绍了一番。"}
{"time": 1773168843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125512010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"御主吗？\"看到了对方手背上的令咒，\"当然可以。\"转头小声和艾蕾耳语\"他选御主的品味一直这样吗？\""}
{"time": 1773168848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170310605", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉？你这家伙不会要做什么串通发牌员行卑鄙事情吧！”\n艾蕾表示不满。"}
{"time": 1773168901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247206718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“聒噪的女神，本王才不会做这种事呢！”"}
{"time": 1773168953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1382902589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1125512010]“不知道，不过乌鲁克传出过他强制要求所有女人将他当做心上人的传闻！”"}
{"time": 1773168969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "951581256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾根本就没有压低音量。"}
