{"time": 1773169610, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440346742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "蒂妮·切尔克发出一张黑桃J，现在场上的公牌是黑桃9，黑桃J，黑桃K，和梅花K"}
{"time": 1773169675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494775984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅，给我看看你的牌呗！”\n艾蕾把脸蛋凑过来。"}
{"time": 1773169740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723578124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把牌递给了她，\"继续追注吗？英雄王。\""}
{"time": 1773169760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388092394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾看了牌差点直接晕倒。"}
{"time": 1773169775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "618047396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么了，牌不是很好吗，杂修？”"}
{"time": 1773169809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132739708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“自然是，show hand，要赌就全部奉上。”"}
