{"time": 1773169871, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884267545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“要不然，这把还是先放弃再说？”"}
{"time": 1773169883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059390154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾在莉维娅耳边小声说。"}
{"time": 1773169942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651312884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，这点钱不算什么的啦。\"拍拍艾蕾的脑袋，\"玩得开心就行。\"转头看向对手，推掉筹码，\"开牌。\""}
{"time": 1773170087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321139286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（我看了那个只哭30次，有人说闪闪在无限剑制检视EA的来了）"}
{"time": 1773170096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2086092707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（笑得我在床上乱动）"}
