{"time": 1773170289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1680342221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（可以用炼金术口胡，就是要过判定）"}
{"time": 1773170302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "439768522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（你要作弊就口胡一下）"}
{"time": 1773170397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53283276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"杂色。\"翻出自己的手牌，露出红桃2和红桃5，\"不过小姑娘发的牌不错，算是个三张吧。\"靠着椅子，看向对手，\"请吧。\""}
{"time": 1773170508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1789201012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd13用了黄金律的闪闪"}
