{"time": 1773170512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952138970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。rd13用了黄金律的闪闪"}
{"time": 1773170512, "type": "reply", "message_id": "952138970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[小黑]使用[用了黄金律的闪闪]演奏出:[1D13=9]"}
{"time": 1773170533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125114304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(四张K"}
{"time": 1773170536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660546873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(豹子啊)"}
{"time": 1773170545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116732925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "闪闪翻开牌，赫然显现出第四张K和一张9"}
{"time": 1773170592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1588607393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“4条K，由吉尔伽美什王赢得对局。”"}
{"time": 1773170656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979608578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"遗憾。\"站起身，顺带拉起还瘫在自己身上的艾蕾，\"和强运的王赌博这种事，这辈子有一次就够了。\"笑着看向对方，\"吉尔伽美什王，有好好享受吗？\""}
{"time": 1773170659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044415501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哼，本王的强运那是自然，不过没想到你竟然没有作弊，看来还是位品行正直之人。”"}
{"time": 1773170691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911748374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哈哈哈哈，本王认可你了，这些筹码都送给你们吧。”"}
{"time": 1773170781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1510667818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“真是有趣，竟然能在这几千年后的今天和过去的熟人对赌，冥界女神呦，我承认你作为此地主人。”"}
{"time": 1773170805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357637695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“唉，果然还是输了…”"}
{"time": 1773170851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967477681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“不过你这金闪闪的家伙也不要太自大，这次圣杯战争不仅有我，伊什塔尔那家伙也在，说不定就要整出什么大活把你给害了。”"}
{"time": 1773170859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879746852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "艾蕾如此说到。"}
{"time": 1773170885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590409091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“哈哈哈，掉链子女神罢了，虽然有点棘手，但是无妨。”"}
{"time": 1773170949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "77048429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唯独这件事我也同有预感呢。\"点头，\"不过既然当事人都这么说了。\"打个哈欠，\"这场圣杯战争，就请好好享受吧。\""}
{"time": 1773170959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1370786776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(男人一生要哭三十次)"}
{"time": 1773171104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2008566014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后闪闪和蒂妮·切尔克离开了赌场。"}
{"time": 1773171115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1403992413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "只剩下桌子上的筹码小山。"}
{"time": 1773171141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528987051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“真是不错的比赛。”\n神父夸赞道。"}
{"time": 1773171141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118019445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好啦，神父先生。\"指了指筹码，\"拿走吧，另外...取走警察们要的东西。\""}
{"time": 1773171179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418475226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"走到他身边，\"我给你的东西，可以当做没看见吗？\"笑容狡猾，后退了一步"}
{"time": 1773171218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012254775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "神父低下头思考了一瞬，表示可以。"}
{"time": 1773171258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967726099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后你们一行人分好筹码，在前台兑换好了钱币，神父上楼取完人偶，就告辞了水晶之丘。"}
{"time": 1773171282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "296699575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1773500142, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1435186981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1773500214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1392671730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "上回说到，那冥界女神和炼金术师与英雄王大战德州扑克，被黄金律斩于马下"}
{"time": 1773500268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "261906216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "在回到房间交付了神父替身人偶后，现在炼金术师、冥界女神和狂信徒三人正在休息"}
{"time": 1773500354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1992154342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“…”送别神父，狂信子看起来有些心事。"}
{"time": 1773500479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "701930264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么了？\"看向狂信子，慵懒地躺在沙发上，眯眯眼"}
{"time": 1773500507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "504278563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那个神父，和警察局那些家伙真的能打赢死徒吗，要不还是我亲自…”"}
{"time": 1773500529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1776685877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "狂信子表情一狠。"}
{"time": 1773500535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883066739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=6F052A96C8B529400631DD478E4C501F.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQVf4NwASVGLszHeGiaY-atna2FdhjiEyD_CiiE-92q1J-TAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhBmPKuPUtnq7gs8oSYmmLNXegI2aIIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAESMEF5O70zqO7pLjhtewxRjQK1_SJR5y0OYURKxVUw7ap_qTZPewHqYwy4TGvRoHbgiA,file_size=2530]"}
{"time": 1773500552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688649777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "（邪恶的死徒小鬼，我这就亲手）"}
{"time": 1773500669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28684645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...既然这么关心，那我们就一起去看看?\"沉思了一会，从沙发上坐起来。"}
{"time": 1773500843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1013056369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“还是不了，莉维娅长…小姐，我自己去就行，您好好休息吧。”"}
{"time": 1773500888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326269367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“只要给予我单独前往的许可就好。”"}
{"time": 1773500898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074700886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"点头，\"如果你想的话。\""}
{"time": 1773501175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277572802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“那么，先行告退。”\n狂信子身上魔力升起，刹那间已经完成装扮更换，换回了最熟悉的那套黑色长袍。"}
{"time": 1773501191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29876662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后她拉卡窗户纵身一跃，消失在了夜里。"}
{"time": 1773501192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1391959459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯。\"等她离开。"}
{"time": 1773501371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229402417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "今夜还有行动吗"}
