{"time": 1773504923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404922565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "莉维娅在第四回合开始时赶到了。"}
{"time": 1773504978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704144025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "背后三对光翼，头生光环的莉维娅眼睛闪闪发光，在夜幕下照亮了周围的阴影。"}
{"time": 1773505013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711576083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“你这是？天使吗？”\n神父震惊地看着莉维娅。"}
{"time": 1773505042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882265176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"杰斯塔桑?\"在空中看着对方，\"这次要怎么逃呢～\"瞥了神父一眼，手指挡在唇前，示意不要声张"}
{"time": 1773505044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649270548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“莉维娅长…小姐，你怎么来了？”\n这狂信子。"}
{"time": 1773505141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1205212639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“可恶，我就知道是你这家伙…”\n捷斯塔咬牙切齿地说。"}
{"time": 1773505231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558617004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"自然是确保这家伙彻底消灭。\"微笑，\"怎么?对我有什么不满意吗？\""}
{"time": 1773505238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2107559195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"杰斯塔桑。\""}
{"time": 1773505304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101037008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后，捷斯塔胸口的刺青旋转起来，身躯猛然增高，变成了一个覆盖坚硬毛皮的怪物。"}
{"time": 1773505456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304993996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷！！！”死徒变化成的怪物发出了咆哮，震碎了周围建筑玻璃。"}
{"time": 1773505468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156207306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眯起眼，\"终究是不被人理承认的怪物，真是可怜。\"打个哈欠，\"死徒有几条命?神父先生。\""}
{"time": 1773505497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471169395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "随后他一抓袭来"}
