{"time": 1773509607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1901935265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "悬停在半空，\"就算变化成非人的形态，你也不过如此。\"微微喘气。"}
{"time": 1773509616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662833270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "捷斯塔不再恋战，挥动断掉的手臂撒出一片鲜血形成血雾。"}
{"time": 1773509629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156599613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "121735290", "user_id": "2388921818"}, "sender": {"id": "2388921818", "name": "我叫五个五"}, "message": "“怎么样，这招以血蒙眼如何啊！”"}
